comments.content:
This is ambiguous because it's hard to say at a first glance what is the difference between `uDollarToken` and `dollar`.
Perhaps it is better to be more concise:
```solidity
UbiquityDollarToken public dollarToken;
dollarToken = UbiquityDollarToken(
  new UupsProxy(
    address(new UbiquityDollarToken()),
    managerPayload
  )
);
```
This way we consider all core contracts to be proxy by default + we can get implementation address any time from the proxy directly

